This repository holds the installers, update manifests and publishing tooling
for JAMARQ Digital LLC's desktop applications. For the Vaexcore desktop
applications (Vaexcore Studio, Vaexcore Pulse, Vaexbot and the Vaexcore suite),
the applications' source code is private and is not part of this repository.

An application published here under its own open-source license (currently
Modlist Launcher, Keeplight and Vaexil Mod Manager, each under the GNU General
Public License version 3) is governed
by that license, not by the terms below, and its source code is available
where its release notes say.

You may download the installers published in this repository's releases and
use the applications they install. Installed copies may fetch updates from the
feeds published here.

